RoyalBlue54L Feather

This folder is the RoyalBlue54L Feather by Lord's Boards
(https://github.com/LordsBoards), as KiCad 10.0.7 ships it among its demo
projects (share/kicad/demos/royalblue54L_feather). It is licensed under
the CERN Open Hardware Licence Version 2 - Permissive (CERN-OHL-P-2.0);
see LICENSE in this folder.

Changes made for the sysmlv2_egui example:
- img/ (the board photographs README.md refers to) is left out.
- .gitmodules, which names library submodules the demo does not include,
  is left out.

No design file is modified.
